<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Untitled Document</title>
    <script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-chtml.js"></script>
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: 'Times New Roman', Times, serif;
            max-width: 800px;
            margin: 40px auto;
            padding: 20px;
            line-height: 1.5;
            color: black;
        }
        .header {
            text-align: center;
            font-size: 24pt;
            font-weight: bold;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
        }
        .subheader {
            text-align: center;
            font-size: 14pt;
            margin-bottom: 40px;
        }
        .section {
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }
        .placeholder {
            width: 100%;
            height: 150px;
            background-color: #f0f0f0;
            border: 1px solid #ccc;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            margin: 20px 0;
            font-style: italic;
            color: #666;
            text-align: center;
        }
        img.placeholder-img {
            max-width: 100%;
            height: auto;
        }
        ul {
            padding-left: 20px;
        }
        ol {
            padding-left: 20px;
        }
        table {
            width: 100%;
            border-collapse: collapse;
            margin: 20px 0;
        }
        th, td {
            border: 1px solid #000;
            padding: 8px;
            text-align: left;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="header">
    [Header: Bold centered title or logo area]
</div>

<div class="subheader">
    [Subtitle: Smaller centered text]
</div>

<div class="section">
    <p><strong>Section 1:</strong> First main section content with paragraph text.</p>
    <p>This is the first paragraph in the first column or zone.</p>
    <p>Second paragraph continues the text flow.</p>
</div>

<div class="section">
    <p><strong>Section 2:</strong> Second column or zone with list items.</p>
    <ul>
        <li>List item 1</li>
        <li>List item 2</li>
        <li>List item 3</li>
    </ul>
    <ol>
        <li>Ordered item 1</li>
        <li>Ordered item 2</li>
    </ol>
</div>

<div class="section">
    <p><strong>Section 3:</strong> Paragraph followed by table.</p>
    <p>This paragraph is aligned left with indentation.</p>

    <table>
        <tr>
            <th>Column 1 Header</th>
            <th>Column 2 Header</th>
        </tr>
        <tr>
            <td>Row 1 Cell 1</td>
            <td>Row 1 Cell 2</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
            <td>Row 2 Cell 1</td>
            <td>Row 2 Cell 2</td>
        </tr>
    </table>
</div>

<div class="placeholder" style="margin-top: 40px;">
    [Diagram: Image or chart placed in this exact position]
    <img src="[Image URL or base64 data]" alt="Placeholder image" class="placeholder-img">
</div>

<div class="section">
    <p><strong>Section 4:</strong> Continued text with signature area at bottom.</p>
    <p>Additional paragraph text here.</p>
    <div style="margin-top: 60px; text-align: right;">
        [Signature: Handwritten or stamped signature block]
    </div>
</div>

</body>
</html>
